{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spray N' Pray</strong> is a fast-paced first-person boomer shooter where you play as Justinian, a priest chosen by God to purge the Earth of demons, hellspawn, and fallen angels. The cathedral is overrun, and only your faith, speed, and firepower can cleanse it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.poster.avif?t=1758337209\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.webm?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.mp4?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your signature dual revolvers, you\u2019ll unleash a storm of righteous bullets while mastering smooth movement; dash, run, and melee-strikes that close the distance between you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.poster.avif?t=1758337209\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.webm?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.mp4?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your ultimate power by merging your revolvers into one divine weapon, unleashing a blistering hail of bullets. And when demons close the gap, crush them with a brutal melee strike to break their ranks. With every kill, you climb closer to your holy reckoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.poster.avif?t=1758337209\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.webm?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.mp4?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026690?t=1758337209","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/a7815b13daa8356ae01c0bc3d81cd691c3d8407a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758337209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/c3dfed57187182f7ec71f2fa675621c6cfba2ece/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758337209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/c3dfed57187182f7ec71f2fa675621c6cfba2ece/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758337209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spray N' Pray</strong> is a fast-paced first-person boomer shooter where you play as Justinian, a priest chosen by God to purge the Earth of demons, hellspawn, and fallen angels. The cathedral is overrun, and only your faith, speed, and firepower can cleanse it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.poster.avif?t=1758337209\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.webm?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.mp4?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your signature dual revolvers, you\u2019ll unleash a storm of righteous bullets while mastering smooth movement; dash, run, and melee-strikes that close the distance between you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.poster.avif?t=1758337209\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.webm?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.mp4?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your ultimate power by merging your revolvers into one divine weapon, unleashing a blistering hail of bullets. And when demons close the gap, crush them with a brutal melee strike to break their ranks. With every kill, you climb closer to your holy reckoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.poster.avif?t=1758337209\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.webm?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.mp4?t=1758337209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Vancouver Film School"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/1d42f3337eab7ef2ccc405824903bd594673e956/header.jpg?t=1758337209","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195896,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195896/movie480.mp4?t=1758337208","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195896/movie_max.mp4?t=1758337208"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195896/330fc86435597cc586896bd3bf17ad25b98ef8d8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758337208","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195896/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758337208","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195896/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758337208"}}],"name":"Spray N' 